            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno, lunebi magi, Aggai ki Jekaria wod pa Iddo, gutito lok bot Lujudaya ma gitye i Juda ki i Jerucalem, i nyiŋ Lubaŋa pa Icrael ma en aye loyogi-ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HAG.1.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ag 1.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.4.6+ZEC.4.7+ZEC.4.8+ZEC.4.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jek 4.6-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok Jerubabel wod pa Cealtiel ki Yecwa wod pa Jojadak gucako gero ot pa Lubaŋa ma tye i Jerucalem odoco; onoŋo lunebi pa Lubaŋa bene tye kacel kwedgi ma konyogi ki tic.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kare meno kikome en aye Tatenai ma laloc me dul lobo me Loka Kulu ki Cetar-bojenai ki ludito wadgi gubino botgi ci guloko kwedgi kit man ni, “Aŋa mumiyowu twero me gero ot man ki me tyeko gedo man?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin bene gupenyogi kit man ni, “Lugedo ma gitye ka gedo-ni nyiŋgi aŋagi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento wan Lubaŋa yam tye ka neno ludoŋo pa Lujudaya, omiyo pe gijuko ticgi nio wan ma lok ma gicwalo-ni oo bot Dario, ma kun gikuro lagam me waraga ma gibidwoko pi lok meno.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Man aye lok ma i waraga ma Tatenai ma en laloc me dul lobo ma tye Loka Kulu ki Cetar-bojenai ki ludito wadgi ducu gucoyo ci gucwalo bot Dario; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gucwalle lok ma gicoyo kit man ni, “Bot kabaka Dario, kuc obed boti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myero kabaka one ni wan wacito i lobo Juda, wao wa i ot pa Lubaŋa madit. Gitye ka gerone ki godi apaya madoŋo, ki dok giguro bao bene me umo kom ot nia ki i dye ot piny nio kwede wa i kwori me dan ot ducu; tic man tye ka wot mot maber twatwal dok ticce ye ciŋgi maber. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wan wapenyo ludoŋo ma kunnu ka waloko botgi kit man ni, ‘Aŋa mumiyowu twero me gero ot man ki me tyeko cel murumo ducu?’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok wapenyo wa nyiŋgi bene, wek watit boti, ka wacoyo nyiŋ ludito ma gitelo wigi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin gugamo dogwa kit man ni, ‘Wan lutic pa Lubaŋa me polo ki lobo, wan watye ka gero ot man odoco, en ot ma yam gigero i lwak mwaka mapol mukato anec, ma con kabaka madit pa jo Icrael ogero nio ka otyeko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2KI.25.8+2KI.25.9+2KI.25.10+2KI.25.11+2KI.25.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Luker 25.8-12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "2CH.36.17+2CH.36.18+2CH.36.19+2CH.36.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2 Tek 36.17-20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.52.12+JER.52.13+JER.52.14+JER.52.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jer 52.12-15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento ka kwarowa yam gumiyo kiniga omako Lubaŋa me polo i komgi, ci omiyogi i ciŋ Nebukadnejar ma Lakaldaya, kabaka me Babilon, ma obalo ot man woko ka oterogi wa I lobo Babilon. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZR.1.2+EZR.1.3+EZR.1.4+EZR.1.5+EZR.1.6+EZR.1.7+EZR.1.8+EZR.1.9+EZR.1.10+EZR.1.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ejira 1.2-11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento i mwaka mukwono me loc pa Ciro kabaka me Babilon, Ciro oketo cik ma miyo twero ni ot pa Lubaŋa man myero giger odoco. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dok bene jami me jabu ki me ryal ma yam gitiyo kwedgi i ot pa Lubaŋa, ma yam Nebukadnejar oyako ki i ot pa Lubaŋa ma yam tye i Jerucalem ci oterogi oketogi i ot pa lubaŋa ma i Babilon, jami magi ducu kabaka Ciro acel-lu aye yam okwanyogi woko ki i ot pa lubaŋa ma tye i Babilon, ka omiyogi bot dano ma nyiŋe Cecbajar, ma yam Ciro oketo obedo laloc; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ka dok ocike ni, “Kwany jami magi itergi iciketgi i ot pa Lubaŋa ma tye i Jerucalem, ka dok iwek giger ot pa Lubaŋa odoco i kabedone kikome.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cecbajar man yam obino ci oketo te guti me ot pa Rwot Lubaŋa ma i Jerucalem; cakke wa i kare ca nio wa koni gubedo ka gerone, ma pud bene peya otum.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZR 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka ce kabaka oneno ni tye atir, wek koŋ giyeny lokke i ot kano lok ma gicoyo ma tye i Babilon, wek ginen atir ka yam kabaka Ciro oketo cik ma omiyo twero me gero ot pa Lubaŋa man ma i Jerucalem-mi odoco. Koŋ kabaka onen kit ma en ŋolo kwede lokke ci ocwal botwa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZR.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZR.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
